    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 250,
        "text": "Hi everyone, thanks for coming to the community garden meeting. We have a problem. The tomato plants are dying because the soil is too dry. Therefore, we need to water them more often. But we also have a water bill to pay, so we must be careful.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d1e28ac3fc21f0cce154a380dcfbe245cff474b935b8ebb33c0803ba59496228",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 257,
        "sourceEnd": 386,
        "text": "I see. If we water the plants every morning, they will grow better. But I can't come every morning because I start work at 7 a.m.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "16edd9d0ccb6c96d6c609f275b2135efedaefd4fcd81d8b444bdbf99a61e919c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 393,
        "sourceEnd": 583,
        "text": "That's a good point. If we make a watering schedule, everyone can help. For example, I can water on Mondays and Wednesdays. Tom, you could water on Tuesdays and Thursdays. What do you think?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "78dc6a58598b0e29d26f45d9755329322c1de669513ef0ec63eda4a011acdc41",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 590,
        "sourceEnd": 705,
        "text": "That sounds fair. But I'm not sure about Fridays. I usually visit my mother on Fridays. Maybe Sarah can do Fridays?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6a1f35101cfca47040982d310de317ffce2d14fea46f589700d98718c64013a3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "sarah",
        "speaker": "Sarah",
        "sourceStart": 714,
        "sourceEnd": 863,
        "text": "Actually, I can't do Fridays either because I have a yoga class. But I can do weekends. If I water on Saturdays and Sundays, the plants will be fine.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "27dee8e9949571550ba730ca7e497eb736c3a45514784452e834c957f5c4420a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 870,
        "sourceEnd": 1019,
        "text": "Great. So we have Monday, Wednesday, Saturday, and Sunday covered. We still need Tuesday, Thursday, and Friday. Tom, can you do Tuesday and Thursday?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9babc0c8cdfaaac3b92789dd2f7eea7c3a1493096624a73fc77d49198ca01a19",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1026,
        "sourceEnd": 1164,
        "text": "Yes, I can. But who will do Friday? We should ask other people in the community. If we put a notice on the board, someone might volunteer.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "021588613309ae1ebc1dbbeac25aef8b16b42ee8f8243c0479f5224fa18e8ed2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1171,
        "sourceEnd": 1298,
        "text": "Good idea. Also, we should collect rainwater. If we put a barrel under the roof, we will have free water. That will save money.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a5956822733384c43051c2e742668e88e26cb3af7fb1b069bf78f46d2711a6fc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1305,
        "sourceEnd": 1421,
        "text": "That's smart. But we must ask the landlord first because it's his building. If he agrees, we can install the barrel.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "88439d09784f9a8542f14b35f515a077a83b395b972528b151853d79e96b3274",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "sarah",
        "speaker": "Sarah",
        "sourceStart": 1430,
        "sourceEnd": 1512,
        "text": "I can talk to him. He's friendly. If I explain the plan, he will probably say yes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "fe855a553e5fd451adcf2fb861d1e3e38118580876403804b3e79b02d07b5ffc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1519,
        "sourceEnd": 1715,
        "text": "Perfect. So, to sum up: we will water according to the schedule, we will ask for more volunteers, and we will try to collect rainwater. If we all work together, the garden will be beautiful again.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b90683323c22c4a8e60f9b847f8c20577913fa6065d6a026321bec41673a1d91",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
